  "title": "The Hereon FABM models OMExDia, NOPE, and light",
  "description": "<p>This is a collection of <a href=\"https://fabm.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABM</a> models developed at Helmholtz-Zentrum hereon GmbH by the ecosystem modeling group. It currently includes</p>\n<ol>\n<li>A <code>light</code> model, based on the GOTM <code>light</code> implementation but with more exact layer averaging</li>\n<li>The <strong>OMExDia</strong> model in several variations. OMExDia is a sediment biogeochemical model</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>OMExDia with phosphorus (<code>omexdia_p</code>)</li>\n<li>OMExDia with methane (<code>omexdia_c</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>The <strong>NOPE</strong> model for Nitrous Oxide Production and Emission</li>\n</ol>",
